#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:202
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:217
msgid "Select **Edit Scheme**."
msgstr "**Edit Scheme**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:93
msgid ""
"In the **All Members > Teams** panel, check the box for **Add Team "
"Members**. This sets the system default for all teams."
msgstr ""
"**All Members > Teams** 패널에서 **Add Team Members** 확인란을 선택합니다. 이렇게 하면 모든 팀에 "
"대한 시스템 기본값이 설정됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:94
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:103
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:131
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:167
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:179
msgid "Select **Save**."
msgstr "**Save**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:95
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:104
msgid "Select the back arrow to return to the **Permission Schemes** menu."
msgstr "뒤로 화살표를 선택해 **Permission Schemes** 메뉴로 돌아갑니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:96
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:133
msgid "Select **New Team Override Scheme**."
msgstr "**New Team Override Scheme**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:98
msgid ""
"Name and describe the scheme. For example, ``Authorized Personnel Only`` "
"with description ``Restrict adding team members to eam and System "
"Admins.``"
msgstr ""
"스킴의 이름과 설명을 입력합니다. 예를 들어 ``Authorized Personnel Only``\\ 와 설명 ``Restrict "
"adding team members to eam and System Admins.``\\ 를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:99
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:136
msgid ""
"Select **Add Teams** to add Team B to the **Select teams to override "
"permissions** list, locate Team B, then select **Add**."
msgstr ""
"**Add Teams**\\ 를 선택해 Team B를 **Select teams to override permissions** 목록에 "
"추가하고, Team B를 찾은 다음 **Add**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:100
msgid "In the **All Members** panel, uncheck the box for **Add Team Members**."
msgstr "**All Members** 패널에서 **Add Team Members** 확인란을 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:101
msgid ""
"In the **Team Administrators** panel, check the box for **Add Team "
"Members**."
msgstr ""
"**Team Administrators** 패널에서 **Add Team Members** 확인란을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:107
msgid "Public and private channel management"
msgstr "공개 및 비공개 채널 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:113
msgid "Restrict who can rename & edit channels"
msgstr "채널 이름 변경 및 편집 가능 사용자 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:115
msgid ""
"Example: As the default for the entire system, restrict renaming channels"
" and editing headers and purposes to admins only."
msgstr ""
"예: 전체 시스템의 기본값으로 채널 이름 변경과 헤더 및 목적 편집을 관리자에게만 제한합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:119
msgid ""
"In the **All Members** panel, uncheck the box for **Manage Public "
"Channels > Manage Channel Settings**."
msgstr ""
"**All Members** 패널에서 **Manage Public Channels > Manage Channel Settings** 확인란을 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:121
msgid ""
"The **Manage Channel Settings** option is now only available to channel "
"admins, team admins, and system admins."
msgstr ""
"이제 **Manage Channel Settings** 옵션은 채널 관리자, 팀 관리자, 시스템 관리자에게만 제공됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:124
msgid "Restrict who can create channels in specific teams"
msgstr "특정 팀에서 채널을 만들 수 있는 사용자 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:126
msgid ""
"Example: In Team C, restrict public channel creation to admins. As the "
"default for all other teams, allow everyone to create public channels."
msgstr ""
"예: Team C에서는 공개 채널 생성을 관리자로 제한합니다. 다른 모든 팀의 기본값으로는 모든 사용자가 공개 채널을 만들 수 있도록 "
"허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:130
msgid ""
"In the **All Members** panel, in the **Manage Public Channels** menu, "
"check the box for **Create Channels**. This sets the system default to "
"allow creation of public channels on all teams."
msgstr ""
"**All Members** 패널의 **Manage Public Channels** 메뉴에서 **Create Channels** 확인란을 "
"선택합니다. 이렇게 하면 모든 팀에서 공개 채널 생성을 허용하도록 시스템 기본값이 설정됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:132
msgid "Select the arrow to return to the **Permission Schemes** interface."
msgstr "화살표를 선택해 **Permission Schemes** 인터페이스로 돌아갑니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:135
msgid ""
"Name and describe the scheme. For example, ``Contractor Scheme`` with "
"description ``Restrict public channel creation to Admins only``."
msgstr ""
"스킴의 이름과 설명을 입력합니다. 예를 들어 ``Contractor Scheme``\\ 과 설명 ``Restrict public channel "
"creation to Admins only``\\ 를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:137
msgid ""
"In the **All Members** panel, in the **Manage Public Channels** section, "
"uncheck the box for **Create Channels**."
msgstr ""
"**All Members** 패널의 **Manage Public Channels** 섹션에서 **Create Channels** 확인란을 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:138
msgid ""
"In the **Team Administrators** panel, in the **Manage Public Channels** "
"section, check the box for **Create Channels**."
msgstr ""
"**Team Administrators** 패널의 **Manage Public Channels** 섹션에서 **Create Channels** 확인란을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:141
msgid "Convert public channels to private channels"
msgstr "공개 채널을 비공개 채널로 변환"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:144
msgid "Allow anyone to convert public channels to private channels"
msgstr "모든 사용자가 공개 채널을 비공개 채널로 변환하도록 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:146
msgid ""
"Example: Set the default setting to allow all members, team admins, and "
"channel admins to convert public channels to private."
msgstr ""
"예: 모든 구성원, 팀 관리자, 채널 관리자가 공개 채널을 비공개로 변환할 수 있도록 기본 설정을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:150
msgid ""
"In the **All Members** panel, uncheck the box for **Manage Public "
"Channels > Convert Channels**."
msgstr ""
"**All Members** 패널에서 **Manage Public Channels > Convert Channels** 확인란을 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:152
msgid ""
"This permission is applied to all other roles (excluding the Guest role)."
" When this permission is not enabled for all members, it must be manually"
" applied to team admins and channel admins if required."
msgstr ""
"이 권한은 다른 모든 역할(게스트 역할 제외)에 적용됩니다. 이 권한이 모든 구성원에게 활성화되어 있지 않으면 필요한 경우 팀 "
"관리자와 채널 관리자에게 수동으로 적용해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:155
msgid "Read-only channels"
msgstr "읽기 전용 채널"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:161
msgid "Members can participate but guests can only read and react"
msgstr "구성원은 참여할 수 있지만 게스트는 읽고 반응만 할 수 있음"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:163
msgid "Go to **System Console > User Management > Channels**."
msgstr "**관리자 도구 > 사용자 관리 > 채널**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:164
msgid "Select **Edit** next to the name of the channel you want to configure."
msgstr "구성하려는 채널 이름 옆의 **Edit**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:165
msgid "In the **Create Posts** panel, uncheck **Guests**."
msgstr "**Create Posts** 패널에서 **Guests**\\ 를 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:166
msgid "In the **Post Reactions** panel, uncheck **Guests** if required."
msgstr "필요한 경우 **Post Reactions** 패널에서 **Guests**\\ 를 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:169
msgid ""
"The channel is available for all members and guests to access, but guests"
" can only read messages and react to them."
msgstr ""
"채널은 모든 구성원과 게스트가 액세스할 수 있지만, 게스트는 메시지를 읽고 반응만 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:172
msgid "Create an announcement channel where only channel admins can post"
msgstr "채널 관리자만 게시할 수 있는 공지 채널 만들기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:174
msgid "Create a new channel (either public or private)."
msgstr "새 채널을 만듭니다(공개 또는 비공개)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:175
msgid "Navigate to **System Console > User Management > Channels**."
msgstr "**관리자 도구 > 사용자 관리 > 채널**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:176
msgid ""
"Select **Edit** next to the name of the channel you just created (you may"
" need to search for it)."
msgstr ""
"방금 만든 채널 이름 옆의 **Edit**\\ 을 선택합니다(검색해야 할 수 있음)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:177
msgid "In the **Create Posts** panel, uncheck **Guests** and **Members**."
msgstr "**Create Posts** 패널에서 **Guests** 및 **Members**\\ 를 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:178
msgid "In the **Post Reactions** panel, uncheck **Guests** and **Members**."
msgstr "**Post Reactions** 패널에서 **Guests** 및 **Members**\\ 를 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:181
msgid ""
"The channel is available for all members and guests to access but only "
"admins can post."
msgstr ""
"채널은 모든 구성원과 게스트가 액세스할 수 있지만 관리자만 게시할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:184
msgid "Message management"
msgstr "메시지 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:187
msgid "Restrict who can delete messages"
msgstr "메시지를 삭제할 수 있는 사용자 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:189
msgid ""
"Example: As the default for the entire system, restrict deleting posts to"
" only system and team admins."
msgstr ""
"예: 전체 시스템의 기본값으로 글 삭제를 시스템 관리자와 팀 관리자에게만 제한합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:193
msgid ""
"In the **All Members** and **Channel Administrators** panels, in the "
"**Delete Posts** section, uncheck the boxes for **Delete Own Posts** and "
"**Delete Others' Posts**."
msgstr ""
"**All Members** 및 **Channel Administrators** 패널의 **Delete Posts** 섹션에서 **Delete Own "
"Posts** 및 **Delete Others' Posts** 확인란을 선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:194
msgid ""
"In the **Channel Administrators** and **Team Administrators** panels, in "
"the **Delete Posts** section, check the boxes for **Delete Own Posts** "
"and **Delete Others' Posts**."
msgstr ""
"**Channel Administrators** 및 **Team Administrators** 패널의 **Delete Posts** 섹션에서 "
"**Delete Own Posts** 및 **Delete Others' Posts** 확인란을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:197
msgid "Restrict who can edit messages"
msgstr "메시지를 편집할 수 있는 사용자 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:199
msgid ""
"Example: As the default for the entire system, only allow users to edit "
"their own posts for five minutes after posting."
msgstr ""
"예: 전체 시스템의 기본값으로 사용자가 게시 후 5분 동안 자신의 글만 편집할 수 있도록 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:203
msgid ""
"In the **All Members**, **Channel Administrators**, and **Team "
"Administrators** panels, in the **Manage Posts** section, check the box "
"for **Edit Posts**."
msgstr ""
"**All Members**, **Channel Administrators**, **Team Administrators** 패널의 **Manage Posts** "
"섹션에서 **Edit Posts** 확인란을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:204
msgid ""
"From any panel, select the gear button to set the global time limit to "
"``300`` seconds."
msgstr ""
"아무 패널에서나 기어 버튼을 선택해 전역 시간 제한을 ``300``초로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:207
msgid "Integration management"
msgstr "통합 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:209
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.2, the System Console provides enhanced controls for "
"managing integrations (webhooks, slash commands, OAuth apps), including "
"separate permissions for managing your own integrations versus other "
"users' integrations."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v11.2부터 관리자 도구는 웹훅, 슬래시 명령어, OAuth 앱 등 통합 관리를 위한 향상된 제어 기능을 "
"제공하며, 자신의 통합을 관리하는 권한과 다른 사용자의 통합을 관리하는 권한을 별도로 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:212
msgid "Restrict who can manage webhooks and slash commands"
msgstr "웹훅과 슬래시 명령어를 관리할 수 있는 사용자 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:214
msgid ""
"Example: As the default for the entire system, only allow system admins "
"to create, edit and delete integrations."
msgstr ""
"예: 전체 시스템의 기본값으로 시스템 관리자만 통합을 생성, 편집, 삭제할 수 있도록 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:218
msgid ""
"In the **All Members** and **Team Administrators** panels, in the "
"**Integrations & Customizations** section, uncheck the boxes for **Manage"
" Incoming Webhooks**, **Manage Outgoing Webhooks**, and **Manage Slash "
"Commands**."
msgstr ""
"**All Members** 및 **Team Administrators** 패널의 **Integrations & Customizations** 섹션에서 "
"**Manage Incoming Webhooks**, **Manage Outgoing Webhooks**, **Manage Slash Commands** 확인란을 "
"선택 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:221
msgid "Administration tools"
msgstr "관리 도구"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:223
msgid ""
"There are a number of API and mmctl tools available for admins to help in"
" configuring and troubleshooting the permissions system:"
msgstr ""
"관리자가 권한 시스템을 구성하고 문제를 해결하는 데 도움이 되는 여러 API 및 mmctl 도구가 제공됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:225
msgid ""
"Reset all permissions to the default on new installations using the "
":ref:`mmctl permissions reset <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-"
"line-tool:mmctl permissions reset>` command."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mmctl permissions reset <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl permissions reset>` "
"명령을 사용해 새 설치의 모든 권한을 기본값으로 재설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:226
msgid ""
"Use the `GetAllRoles "
"<https://api.mattermost.com/#tag/roles/operation/GetAllRoles>`__ API "
"endpoint to get a list of all roles."
msgstr ""
"`GetAllRoles <https://api.mattermost.com/#tag/roles/operation/GetAllRoles>`__ API 엔드포인트를 "
"사용해 모든 역할 목록을 가져옵니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:227
msgid ""
"Add permissions to a role using the :ref:`mmctl permissions add "
"<administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl permissions "
"add>` command."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mmctl permissions add <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl permissions add>` "
"명령을 사용해 역할에 권한을 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:230
msgid "Backend infrastructure"
msgstr "백엔드 인프라"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:232
msgid ""
"Technical admins or developers looking for a deeper understanding of the "
"permissions backend can refer to our :doc:`permissions backend "
"documentation </administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-"
"backend-infrastructure>`."
msgstr ""
"권한 백엔드를 더 깊이 이해하려는 기술 관리자 또는 개발자는 :doc:`권한 백엔드 문서 </administration-guide/onboard"
"/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure>`\\ 를 참조할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:235
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "용어집"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:237
msgid ""
"**Permission:** The ability to execute certain actions. Permissions are "
"granted to roles."
msgstr ""
"**권한:** 특정 작업을 실행할 수 있는 능력입니다. 권한은 역할에 부여됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:238
msgid "**Roles:** A set of permissions. Users or groups are assigned to roles."
msgstr "**역할:** 권한의 집합입니다. 사용자 또는 그룹이 역할에 할당됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:239
msgid ""
"**Group:** A set of users, usually synced from AD/LDAP. Groups are "
"assigned to roles in the context of teams, channels, or system-wide."
msgstr ""
"**그룹:** 일반적으로 AD/LDAP에서 동기화되는 사용자 집합입니다. 그룹은 팀, 채널 또는 시스템 전체 컨텍스트에서 역할에 "
"할당됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:240
msgid ""
"**Default Roles:** All Members, Guests (if enabled), channel admins, team"
" admins, system admins."
msgstr ""
"**기본 역할:** 모든 구성원, 게스트(활성화된 경우), 채널 관리자, 팀 관리자, 시스템 관리자."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:241
msgid "**System Scheme:** A set of default roles that apply system-wide."
msgstr "**시스템 스킴:** 시스템 전체에 적용되는 기본 역할 집합입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:242
msgid ""
"**Team Override Scheme:** A set of default roles that apply only in the "
"team specified. Permissions granted to roles in a Team Override Scheme "
"overrides roles in the System Scheme."
msgstr ""
"**팀 재정의 스킴:** 지정된 팀에만 적용되는 기본 역할 집합입니다. 팀 재정의 스킴의 역할에 부여된 권한은 시스템 스킴의 역할을 "
"재정의합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:243
msgid ""
"**System-wide:** Applies across the entire system, including all teams of"
" which the user is a member."
msgstr ""
"**시스템 전체:** 사용자가 구성원인 모든 팀을 포함해 전체 시스템에 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions.rst:244
msgid "**Team-wide:** Applies in a specific team only."
msgstr "**팀 전체:** 특정 팀에만 적용됩니다."
